    // #1095: HARIMU_VARKAND_NATIONAL_SERVICE_ENABLED sits in this pack. A Varkand citizen's first 7 real days are a recruit term on the citizen read.
    // #1324: HARIMU_WAR_EVACUATION_ENABLED sits in this pack (needs HARIMU_WAR_ENABLED). A capture evacuates that city's citizens to the nearest home city.
